Content and data
----------------

The reference-architecture values in the application are derived from public vendor
documentation (NVIDIA DGX SuperPOD and Enterprise Reference Architectures, NVIDIA data
sheets, and vendor manuals). Each value in the inspector names its source, and a value
that no public source confirms is marked "assumed" with the reason.

The operator documents in runbooks/, handbook/, and handson/ are original material of
this project. They cite public vendor documentation; the cited pages keep their own terms.
